title: Joint-list government with CUP external support

You should not be here??! Report a bug if you see this 🙏🙏

please please do so via <a class="link" target="_blank" href="https://github.com/broken-arrows/route_to_itaca/issues">GitHub Issues</a>

you're allowed to make a wish once you do so! ✨

- @post_event.make_a_wish

@erc_player_jxsi_led
title: JxSí <span class="generalitat-coalition" data-parties="jxsi" data-summary="Minority government - [+ jxsi_parlament_s +]/[+ parlament_s_majority +]; with CUP external support - [+ jxsi_parlament_s + cup_parlament_s +]/[+ parlament_s_majority +]"><span style="color: var(--jxsi); font-style: italic;">minority Government</span></span> with CUP support
view-if: parlament_coalition_option_jxsi_min_cup_visible and player_party == "erc"
choose-if: parlament_coalition_sovereignty_jxsi_available
unavailable-subtitle: [? if jxsi_parlament_s + cup_parlament_s < parlament_s_majority: Not enough parliamentary support. ?] [+ parlament_coalition_sovereignty_jxsi_trust_reasons +]
subtitle: The CUP seems open to support such a government while remaining an external "critical watching eye" over it.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind = "jxsi";
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase = 1;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leader = "jxsi";
    Q.parlament_coalition_follower = "cup";
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_cabinet = ["jxsi"];
    Q.parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_cabinet.reduce(function (n, p) { return n + Q[p + "_parlament_s"]; }, 0);
    Q.parlament_coalition_support_seats = Q.parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats + Q.cup_parlament_s;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president = Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name = Q[Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president + "_leader"];
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_gender = Q[Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president + "_leader_gender"];


    if (!(Q.cup_endavant_strength + Q.cup_poblelliure_strength + Q.cup_thirdsector_strength > 0)) {
        Q.cup_endavant_strength = 35;
        Q.cup_poblelliure_strength = 35;
        Q.cup_thirdsector_strength = 20;
        Q.cup_endavant_dissent = 15;
        Q.cup_poblelliure_dissent = 15;
        Q.cup_thirdsector_dissent = 10;
    }
    Q.coalition_phase_timer = 1;
    Q.month_actions += 1;
!}
call: parlament_coalition_sovereignty.initialize

Before negotiations can properly begin, the Parlament needs to convene, and a Speaker of the House needs to be chosen. Given the results, it is expected to be a JxSí one, but we can always offer it to the CUP as a gesture of good will.

- @jxsi_speaker: Retain the Speaker of the House
- @cup_speaker: Offer the Speaker of the House to the CUP

