Before negotiations can properly begin, the Parlament needs to convene, and a Speaker of the House needs to be chosen. Given the results, it is expected to be a JxSí one, but we can always try to push for us to have it instead, probably.

- @jxsi_speaker: Support JxSí's nominee for Speaker of the House
- @cup_speaker: Push for us to have the Speaker of the House instead

