@cup_speaker
title: Elect a CUP Speaker of the House
on-arrival: {!
    Q.speaker_party = "cup";
    Q.speaker = Q.year < 2017 ? "Julià de Jòdar" : "Vidal Aragonés";
    Q.speaker_gender = "m";
!}
go-to: post_speaker

@jxsi_speaker
title: Elect a JxSí Speaker of the House
on-arrival: {!
    Q.speaker_party = "jxsi";
    Q.speaker = "Carme Forcadell";
    Q.speaker_gender = "f";
!}
go-to: post_speaker

@jxcat_speaker
title: Elect a JxCat Speaker of the House
on-arrival: {!
    Q.speaker_party = "jxcat";
    Q.speaker = Q.jxcat_leader != "Laura Borràs" && Q.junts_leader != "Laura Borràs" ? "Laura Borràs" : "Albert Batet";
    Q.speaker_gender = Q.speaker == "Laura Borràs" ? "f" : "m";
!}
go-to: post_speaker

@post_speaker

[+ speaker +] ([+ speaker_party +]) will be the Speaker of the House for this legislature. Officially the second authority of the country, [+ speaker_party +] will now have a decisive role in the legislative agenda moving forwards.

- @post_event: And so, time passes...
